SUMMARY:Deadline: NewImages Festival 2027: XR\, Fulldome & Virtual Worlds C
 ompetitions (Paris)
DESCRIPTION:NewImages Festival\, the Paris festival for XR and immersive cr
 eation\, opens three competitions for its 2027 edition. XR COMPETITION: wo
 rks completed in 2026 or 2027 in VR\, AR\, mixed reality\, narrative video
  games and hybrid performances\; Grand Prize EUR 6\,000\, Impact Award EUR
  3\,000\; fee EUR 75 Early Bird / EUR 100 Last Call (individual talents EU
 R 45 / EUR 60).\n\nOrganisation: NewImages Festival\nLocation: Paris\, Fra
 nce (festival presentation\; open internationally)\nAward: XR Competition:
  Grand Prize EUR 6\,000 and Impact Award EUR 3\,000. Fulldome Competition:
  Dome Award EUR 3\,000. Virtual Worlds Competition: Virtual Worlds Award E
 UR 3\,000. Submission fees for XR and Fulldome: EUR 75 Early Bird / EUR 10
 0 Last Call (EUR 45 / EUR 60 for individual talents)\; Virtual Worlds Comp
 etition is free to enter. Selected works get festival presentation and two
  accreditations.\nDuration: Festival edition 2027\; submissions open 4 Sep
 tember to 22 December 2026 (Early Bird deadline 10 December 2026).\n\nMore
 : https://www.newimages.art/calls-for-projects?utm_source=artificialnouvea
 ugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.newimages.art/calls-for-projects?utm_source=artificialnouve
 augrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Paris\, France (festival presentation\; open internationally)
END:VEVENT
