SUMMARY:Deadline: dm-Award connecting worlds 2027: PLAYGROUND (projection m
 apping and public-space media art\, EUR 10\,000 prize plus up to EUR 20\,0
 00 production\, SCHLOSSLICHTSPIELE Karlsruhe)
DESCRIPTION:The UNESCO City of Media Arts Office of Karlsruhe's Department 
 of Cultural Affairs awards the dm-Award connecting worlds\, with dm-droger
 ie markt as awarding partner\, ZKM | Center for Art and Media Karlsruhe as
  curatorial partner and KME as organiser of the SCHLOSSLICHTSPIELE Light F
 estival.\n\nOrganisation: Karlsruhe UNESCO City of Media Arts Office (Cult
 ural Office)\, with dm-drogerie markt\, ZKM | Center for Art and Media Kar
 lsruhe and KME Karlsruhe Marketing und Event\nLocation: Karlsruhe\, German
 y (palace facade and Market Square). Open internationally to individual ar
 tists and collectives.\nAward: EUR 10\,000 prize plus up to EUR 20\,000 ne
 t production funding for the winning project (covering fees\, technical eq
 uipment and travel)\, with curatorial and technical support from the Cultu
 ral Office\, KME and ZKM.\nDuration: Presented for 4 weeks between mid-Aug
 ust and mid-September 2027 during the SCHLOSSLICHTSPIELE Light Festival an
 d the exhibition Media art is here.\n\nMore: https://www.cityofmediaarts.d
 e/en/events/apply-now-open-call-dm-award-connecting-worlds/?utm_source=art
 ificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
