SUMMARY:Deadline: Ljudmila: Parameter Generative Arts Fair at Adela Festiva
 l 2027 (open call)
DESCRIPTION:Ljudmila Art and Science Laboratory invites artists to present 
 and sell existing works at Parameter\, a generative arts fair held during 
 the Adela Festival 2027 at Kino Siska in Ljubljana.\n\nOrganisation: Ljudm
 ila Art and Science Laboratory\nLocation: Kino Siska\, Ljubljana\, Sloveni
 a (fair on Saturday 6 March 2027\, part of the Adela Festival 2027). Artis
 ts present in person.\nAward: NO artist fee or production budget for the f
 air itself. Accommodation provided and travel reimbursed up to EUR 150. Ju
 ry prize: a solo exhibition at Kino Siska in 2028 with a EUR 700 gross art
 ist fee. Two honorary mentions of EUR 350 gross each. Artists may sell wor
 k at the fair with no commission taken. No application or participation fe
 es.\nDuration: 1-day fair\, 6 March 2027\n\nMore: https://umfrage.servus.a
 t/index.php/541697?lang=en&utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_mediu
 m=referral
