SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 CET: Journalismuspreis Informatik 2026 (German-langu
 age journalism on computing and society)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 15 Jan 2027 at 23:59 CET.\n\nAn award for German-languag
 e journalism that explains computer science and its impact on society\, fo
 r work published in 2026. Three categories (Text\, Audio\, Video/Multimedi
 a) each carry EUR 5\,000. Submissions open 2 November 2026 and close 15 Ja
 nuary 2027\, 23:59 German time. No nationality restriction is stated. No a
 pplication fee.\n\nOrganisation: Saarland Ministry for Digital Affairs wit
 h Saarland Informatics Campus\nLocation: Remote submission\; award ceremon
 y in Saarbrücken\, Germany\, on 11 May 2027. German-language work.\nAward
 : EUR 5\,000 in each of three categories (Text\, Audio\, Video/Multimedia)
 .\nDuration: Prize for work published in 2026.\n\nMore: https://journalism
 uspreis.saarland-informatics-campus.de/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantd
 esk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://journalismuspreis.saarland-informatics-campus.de/?utm_source=ar
 tificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
